{"excerpt_id": "c1_prompt", "source_id": "s2", "session_id": "01a11a92-78e9-7bd0-a1a9-9312615e7d4f", "source_line": 1193, "source_line_sha256": "cc4dad9f7f567c3572b4de9fd33ef5dcd5cbbb441e913c92f8155642c0c50f6f", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T02:57:24.057Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 119, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "新建一个任务，现在有一个问题，就是我们实际给板子上的第一个通道加上了5v电压，但是上位机显示的是第七个通道。现在不知道是板子错了，还是上位机错了。你能不能上FPGA去实际看一下。fpga的话用最终工程。可以参考本机的fpga skill。", "text_sha256": "479fb2cad406b8742a973ae943e87fede5f7158220cb23b26707263f01c9a061"}
{"excerpt_id": "c1_observation", "source_id": "s2", "session_id": "01a11a92-78e9-7bd0-a1a9-9312615e7d4f", "source_line": 2636, "source_line_sha256": "cb7d79a81de25774c802b4581a6e82d2b92f67971ed51b9a65900eee70ec9455", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T03:49:48.622Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 180, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "**实测结果：错位已出现在 Qt 收到数据之前。** FPGA 的 ADC1 原始数据总线在读取计数 `channel_index=6` 时反复出现约 +5 V 的码值 `0x403C–0x403E`；UDP 上对应的 `CH06` 平均值为 16,439.923，约 `+5.017 V`。当前上位机从 `CH00` 开始编号，所以 `CH06` 是第七行。", "text_sha256": "ec9361ae3b31bbc56c26b5a6b1b7695484796baf34d02f2bb731d80d35583a18"}
{"excerpt_id": "c1_timing", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 240, "source_line_sha256": "fdc1e7a54dd255d5f248eec19d57ba3eaf6ba1e269e1946633a75f8720e751aa", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T03:58:14.707Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 362, "character_end_exclusive": 1264, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "问题在于流水采集路径：发行顶层默认 `ADC_PIPELINED_CAPTURE=1`，控制器在发出下一次 `CONVST` 时开始读取上一帧。ADC 控制器使用 `RD_LOW_CYCLES=2`、`RD_HIGH_CYCLES=1`；采集时钟为 32 MHz，因此八个通道读完约需 **24 个时钟周期，也就是 0.75 µs**。[顶层默认值](<D:/fpga+stm32_project/co_project/Final_pro/ADC_transmission_flash_param_rate_project_clean/rtl/fpga_adc_udp_flash_param_top.v:16>) [读出参数与流水逻辑](<D:/fpga+stm32_project/co_project/Final_pro/ADC_transmission_flash_param_rate_project_clean/rtl/ad7606c_device_frontend.v:197>) [32 MHz 时钟](<D:/fpga+stm32_project/co_project/Final_pro/ADC_transmission_flash_param_rate_project_clean/rtl/clock_reset_ctrl.v:39>)\n\n手册给出的无过采样转换时间是 0.5–0.65 µs，并说明 `BUSY` 下降沿会更新 ADC 输出寄存器；在转换期间读数据，必须在该下降沿前读完。按当前配置，**V6 到 V8 的读出可能落在输出寄存器更新之后**，不符合手册要求，足以造成帧内容异常。[手册转换时间及 BUSY 约束](<D:/fpga+stm32_project/C5371769_ADC-DAC-专用型_AD7606C-16BSTZ_规格书_WJ1834273.txt:424>) [并行读出约束](<D:/fpga+stm32_project/C5371769_ADC-DAC-专用型_AD7606C-16BSTZ_规格书_WJ1834273.txt:1824>)", "text_sha256": "1bf92a13288029cbbca6f4291078b479ab513add70a09a8a893235eed214fd81"}
{"excerpt_id": "c1_initial_proposal", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 440, "source_line_sha256": "2cbe6c6838fb1b85c86dcadf3decc646a3e23b82312407e26fb5a14ecb8b9495", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T05:09:55.701Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 1081, "character_end_exclusive": 1332, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "**可以解决，建议先做一个最小 A/B：**在现有工程中关闭流水采集，让控制器等 `BUSY` 下降后再读 V1～V8；当前默认 500 kSPS 的采样周期是 2 µs，转换加读帧预计能放得下。然后给实际 CH01 输入信号，检查软件信号是否从 CH06 回到 CH00。若仍错位，再用 `FRSTDATA` 和首个 RD 脉冲确认读数起点，并核对端口到 ADC 输入的板级映射。不要先把软件通道标签整体平移，否则会掩盖底层读帧问题。若运行在 1 MSPS，顺序读取方案可能来不及，需要另行优化时序。", "text_sha256": "dd6c27f91f250c6803faebd32e61d9a73c4d7fad59324639420357aeb7af038e"}
{"excerpt_id": "c1_constraint", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 447, "source_line_sha256": "86ef2d0aa16e37788a16617b5b2cb797dc9b2029e54730160199a7c45896ee86", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T05:18:00.831Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 62, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "新建一个任务去尝试修改。工程默认启用流水采集，下一次 `CONVST` 时开始读取上一帧  ，这个是怕1Mhz时序资源不够。", "text_sha256": "b1030ded6f75327aac56f8e9bd262e898d0ce63cac0e15ec7107f71a539392a3"}
{"excerpt_id": "c1_revision", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 456, "source_line_sha256": "9d5c4982b24b0af06a4fe0099f03a88c1428265b55b90582204cdd33e35ff46f", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T05:18:14.423Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 99, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "我会新建任务，并把“保留 1 MSPS 流水吞吐”列为硬约束；修改方向优先检查流水帧对齐和 `FRSTDATA`，不会把关闭流水当作解决方案。先按项目编号规则创建任务，再检查可行的 RTL 修改点。", "text_sha256": "398535d9dc8e671a4ed298f88203fc8a225510f763fbdf7f09d5c939ce2fb55e"}
{"excerpt_id": "c1_simulation", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1082, "source_line_sha256": "6c5b3ca07550d0f5b6455abb534a2ce44e30b8d1ba497250ec644215e8030ffc", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T05:44:00.985Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 104, "character_end_exclusive": 602, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": false, "text": "定向仿真通过：连续 12 帧通道顺序正确，无 BUSY 超时；21 个时钟的 BUSY 高电平下，最后一个 RD 下降沿至少提前下一次 BUSY 下降 **7 个时钟（约 219 ns）**，高于数据手册规定的 25 ns。可用 [独立仿真脚本](D:/fpga+stm32_project/co_project/Final_pro/ADC_transmission_flash_param_rate_project_clean/scripts/run_ad7606c_pipeline_sim.ps1) 复跑；记录见[验证报告](D:/fpga+stm32_project/results/task004/validation.md)。\n\n整套 smoke 中，`runtime_config_manager` 测试在 10 μs 报超时，脚本却仍返回 0；其余相关 ADC 测试通过，因此整套 smoke 不能算全绿。本次只完成了行为仿真，未综合、实现或上板。当前 RTL/XDC 未接入 FRSTDATA，所以**实测端口循环映射是否已消除，仍需上板用已知通道信号确认**；任务保持进行中。", "text_sha256": "ba307f341d8ff9c5130f00752c8d976a0d004516fd45222f1e4d2ba49cb55139"}
{"excerpt_id": "c2_prompt", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1105, "source_line_sha256": "94987cade0e76e0e8b7eb8a9ceaefa3352876d2ee58ba96e4a5bdbc0a20d66b7", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:10:30.202Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 38, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "现在需要fpga全流程最终修复，最后生成bit流。FRSTDATA需要接吗？", "text_sha256": "e6816c6b8c02897f1cf3ff70eb7e7ec441b89da61552431e75de20dc7da075ea"}
{"excerpt_id": "c2_pin1", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1233, "source_line_sha256": "ea8b95c16ffa5ddda87b9350507977cef51b6f7f0ae4d315cfca4aa3732a42bb", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:13:18.413Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 20, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "adc1的Firstdata引脚是k15", "text_sha256": "70df76100ff83166a860a69ef30f0e6226c385c2d529adfde55e56de0b65746c"}
{"excerpt_id": "c2_wrong_pin", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1238, "source_line_sha256": "45c6a46d7f3b874e7553e7a1f2c607ef07e07dec9149ca6bf15398351ffc4a2c", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:13:23.126Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 109, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "收到，ADC1 的 FRSTDATA 是 K15；这与现有 ADC1_BUSY=J15 不冲突。我按原理图继续核对并采用 ADC2=F5、ADC3=G6，随后让 Vivado 的器件/引脚 DRC 实际验证这三个管脚。", "text_sha256": "e418f4eb1be24bc15159445d2023f015bbceb5c042fd6765786910b40ac9032c"}
{"excerpt_id": "c2_pin_correction", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1302, "source_line_sha256": "20a94a55c2f019325b1bb3abf0b51bad7f82bc4f2aa0481b6316fc1728ff0587", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:14:40.387Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 40, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "adc2的Firstdata引脚是F14,adc3的Firstdata引脚是G6", "text_sha256": "a498b5a458b9b11b0e52e9f484eb8f5159027b9168e7fdb18f1d35e4bef40c0b"}
{"excerpt_id": "c2_model_result", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1680, "source_line_sha256": "c2f21f440ad99f9c7af08d1614db75ea745f6e86138bdf085cbb1a4b3e63fdf9", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:30:36.284Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 362, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "**FRSTDATA 不接也能读取 ADC，但这次帧首错位问题建议接。** 我已把它接入三片 ADC 的帧校验：ADC1=`K15`、ADC2=`F14`、ADC3=`G6`。每帧要求首个读字 V1 对应 FRSTDATA 高、后续 V2～V8 对应低；标记不符时会拒收该帧并停止采集，错误码为 `0x31`～`0x33`。这是错位保护，不会自动重排物理通道。\n\n完整流程已通过：1 MSPS 的 12 帧顺序仿真通过，故意制造 FRSTDATA 错位时也确认不会输出无效帧。Vivado 2025.1 对 `xc7a100tcsg324-2` 完成综合、布局布线和 bitgen；WNS=`+0.217 ns`、WHS=`+0.046 ns`，DRC **0 个错误**。另有 5 项与 ADC 无关的警告，详见验证记录。", "text_sha256": "a81514d425045f12b3b548b50cd477126ddbcde95b730987ba4e7662a2a46f9f"}
{"excerpt_id": "c2_human_result", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1933, "source_line_sha256": "149ebab9d891ac15eca0fcb91690b4201e3fd0482cf9931a80b1a8e0d580afd6", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:55:31.474Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 33, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "我刚刚逐个测试了一下，现在通道顺序对了。现在三个task都可以归档", "text_sha256": "409fb516895db5552828fac874190ba5237b290024d0fb2646f8c9c616524468"}
{"excerpt_id": "c3_prompt", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1710, "source_line_sha256": "b41c3e6203a13092b93dc06d9da18112ec2d52249620c089af91973e0e7a0d59", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:34:04.883Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 39, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "那你写入qspi试一下，我看看能不能行。qspi的分区，开机自动启动，你没改吧", "text_sha256": "1bbdf7d5e876218ecb7c821d9726c9b88c65c89839154a27759db0d6d14f9fa2"}
{"excerpt_id": "c3_boundary", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1769, "source_line_sha256": "ea3c558ebbd96c03041c60616baf5c96bd0ac0afa7e15086adc1d0021d69f449", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:35:11.900Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 189, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "我核对了工程分区：`0x000000–0x7FFFFF` 是启动 bitstream，参数 A/B 在 `0x800000` 和 `0xC00000`；新镜像结束于 `0x1CE35C`。现有下载脚本按镜像范围擦写并校验，不会把参数分区纳入擦写范围。QSPI 参数管理 RTL 和 Master-SPI 启动配置没有改动；我现在检查实际连接的 FPGA/Flash，再执行写入。", "text_sha256": "5fd85bf739fbe2521eff189484a839590394854057875d41044f73b23941061e"}
{"excerpt_id": "c3_verify", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1850, "source_line_sha256": "08b2e821e1b4c933b4628cdf92d6255aa26fb60bea7517c2729fea6b26f0e797", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:38:08.391Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 137, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "QSPI 的 Program/Verify 已成功，1,893,212 字节镜像通过校验，脚本确认只覆盖 `0x000000` 起的镜像范围。接下来我会从 QSPI 重新配置一次 FPGA 并检查 DONE；这能验证镜像可启动，但真正的断电上电自动启动仍需物理断电重启确认。", "text_sha256": "4a8a04459b84ed355012d57822db41390b6d4ed3aca313457d2988c508f52123"}
{"excerpt_id": "c3_model_limit", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 1926, "source_line_sha256": "31f27a35dc4ceead2f9146b2bc3d30f1386d9ca2e99ebcbc3e6af1269dcc932b", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T06:40:10.538Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 236, "character_end_exclusive": 333, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "这次确认了从 QSPI 加载成功，但还没有对**更新后的镜像**做整板断电再上电测试。你现在可以查看板卡运行情况；要确认冷启动自动加载，还需完全断电后再上电。实际通道映射也仍需接入已知信号复测。", "text_sha256": "d5a5c4456de972bbab0e2bd968714d33c4de7746135731ba822bb5f59756423e"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_prompt", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 2804, "source_line_sha256": "fe1e584f8ee63030f48792107169b4102bf9eecd91a9e26a97294fc29be1f209", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T07:21:30.273Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 59, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "## 现在需要在上位机新增一个通道数据保存的功能\n\n加一个勾选的按钮，选择，就能把24路通道的数据保存到一个excel", "text_sha256": "05e05cae8207b60b17680663768901fe86a0794c0c8ebee6dbc028b43e1b0a96"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_user_correction", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3294, "source_line_sha256": "54711ec47685e71f44d1067af496257ce577f3a7b4acce46c486ec047175e6c2", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T07:50:21.236Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 98, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "有几处不对，第一，它保存的数据除了码值也有对应的电伏值。第二，我发现，它是运行过程中才能选择是否保存结果，选择了之后，这个结果还会越来越大，我觉得这并不好，应该是先选择再运行，也可以不选直接运行。", "text_sha256": "b7533a395401f99eab6f669f3787ae6317973d5232a9d91996dfd8ef7ddc2adb"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_plan", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3323, "source_line_sha256": "2b39377c31531499b60c8e6785ef836e012a00d0118ff3fd72b8c44e28316ff3", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T07:51:25.410Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 85, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "明白：保存路径应在开始采集前选好，也允许不保存；每路同时写原始码值和电压值。我会让最终 CSV 在停止采集后才生成，运行期间写入临时文件，避免用户选定的结果文件不断变大。", "text_sha256": "50f83ff503195876e03719670b492073a27045147621836c4b73d2bb5c854a5b"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_txt_request", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3507, "source_line_sha256": "fb6abfec19d5fe20beb67daffd40471ccefa5e949efac01d695e70392f6e07c5", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:10:14.303Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 14, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "csv很难打开，用txt吧。", "text_sha256": "a264be23430a7ea6093a89dce9b243e52ec35c312ca8b19959e463d8bdfb6202"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_compile_error", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3556, "source_line_sha256": "6145de2116b0939cf5e9e5d7b223ec79e0e6359453aff4dcfd9d7518b4534f1d", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:11:24.983Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 60, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "刚才编译发现文本格式改动时误删了表头函数声明；我正在修正后重编。文件格式和界面设置已经切换为制表符分隔的 `.txt`。", "text_sha256": "a54e9fcc5e1ed7d78dcdc9b6d5e2f5993979094c5b197c04e6ca1cd685472338"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_compile_result", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3593, "source_line_sha256": "502f9a76f63095eedc6178871795d9c0482034e3d6ca6112c721988ab344868b", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:12:08.167Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 74, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "`.txt` 版本已重新编译并打包：每行是制表符分隔，含包序号、样本序号、时间，以及 24 路各自的码值和电压。最终文件扩展名固定为 `.txt`。", "text_sha256": "9ed17d68e70dddaec0a7b923fb851bec47acae1aad766627c95c94b582b5e6f9"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_large_file_prompt", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3691, "source_line_sha256": "3fb86e97c696bffca9ef1aff40df6f717ed397f650c4567c7c86b0e75f58207d", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:41:32.534Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 59, "character_end_exclusive": 102, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "我发现这个txt并没有列对齐，你能看到吗？不用强制打开，它很大。是我的打开方式不对吗？", "text_sha256": "ed5a6b009273fe35e65eb8593e096adade9433aa9e39f2aac9f7034009927d06"}
{"excerpt_id": "c4_format_result", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3713, "source_line_sha256": "f3f4608e42c67a65b599957f8dafe8af383242de9cf0ed624756dd6b5db7ebf5", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:42:36.974Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 74, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "我只读取了文件开头几行，没有加载整个文件。文件约 **1.15 GB**；表头和数据行都有 **51 列、50 个实际制表符**，分列写入是正确的。", "text_sha256": "2b5eec9c15c80d28c4036dc982d825c6e870db813561c486ae6f57c6a096fef6"}
{"excerpt_id": "c5_error_prompt", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3609, "source_line_sha256": "6472257bf8420e83442c0594609c9cd7065f0d3f5ee66875a1a4caa52cfaa6c7", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:28:58.939Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 594, "character_end_exclusive": 681, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "WSA=10013。请关闭占用数据端口的程序。\n[16:27:00.279] 本机UDP监测未成功绑定，未向FPGA发送START。\n\n之前能启动，现在启动不了了，怎么回事？", "text_sha256": "a97d05a736315045bbdc460d67802edebdac247588302d316bad1c5f2b93a5d1"}
{"excerpt_id": "c5_first_check", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3616, "source_line_sha256": "e433ad22d036f1d50e2addf90d5f45a0b5fac393b178b7589f76caa2826adfe8", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:29:13.739Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 58, "character_end_exclusive": 115, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": false, "text": "日志里的 `WSA=10013` 是系统拒绝绑定，定位这两项能区分是重复启动了上位机/监测程序，还是网卡地址问题。", "text_sha256": "bee9d84a24ad3e49cf6dbd41bddf1999c42b4acd1c9b23b3d0c214b7dbfd1514"}
{"excerpt_id": "c5_diagnosis", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3647, "source_line_sha256": "93a61a0f6e8176a0c60cea240fd026a5038eb7ae4eec9324adfeed862186acb4", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:30:01.306Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 77, "character_end_exclusive": 188, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "但 Windows 当前预留的 UDP 端口范围是 **56458–56557**，采集卡配置使用的 **56555** 正好在范围内，所以绑定返回 `WSA=10013`。这不是 TXT 保存改动或 ADC 故障造成的。", "text_sha256": "8de1632d995259f304166e3913b41984738fd1c755c67819eb9c431c433fce27"}
{"excerpt_id": "c5_workaround", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3647, "source_line_sha256": "93a61a0f6e8176a0c60cea240fd026a5038eb7ae4eec9324adfeed862186acb4", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:30:01.306Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 190, "character_end_exclusive": 337, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": false, "text": "可以这样恢复：在“配置与状态”把**数据 UDP 端口**从 `56555` 改为 `58000`，点击“应用配置”并等确认成功，再开始采集。我检查过，`58000` 不在当前系统预留范围内，也没有进程占用。若希望重启后仍使用这个端口，再在 FPGA READY 状态下点“保存到Flash”。", "text_sha256": "35d0ebbd9e63f53044aa840a6aaab1161f9d91f7b2b9a25d05e72bb6bf41c3d5"}
{"excerpt_id": "c5_user_question", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3668, "source_line_sha256": "7672e9b6ff9938f24ee8ff10612382209d99bff33a6a39931bffb17d1b917ffe", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:32:18.933Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 19, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "很奇怪，是这个上位机把电脑udp改了吗", "text_sha256": "34d3f0f0ac737792e9fe633895d6958419214fd34bbfe12546439a8ac3f65b3c"}
{"excerpt_id": "c5_causal_limit", "source_id": "s1", "session_id": "01a123e8-9a10-7e43-bfb1-1d722e1a5198", "source_line": 3684, "source_line_sha256": "a0681e3edeb9c6ea14864c75d1e145de4e8a9d6b4c1673a0bbd01a09d2fe1195", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-10T08:32:44.445Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 209, "character_end_exclusive": 283, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": false, "text": "因此这次失败的上位机尝试没有把端口“改掉”。现在看到的系统预留范围来自 Windows 或其他系统组件；仅凭目前信息还不能确定具体是哪个组件设置的。", "text_sha256": "9dcd81b36ce4d1607075f91cdc13c0997dd8cb7360f29fcc1c4da090fbc50abf"}
{"excerpt_id": "c6_report_request", "source_id": "s3", "session_id": "01a16367-65ae-79f3-9fb4-524bd2443797", "source_line": 10, "source_line_sha256": "fe282ec179dd40abcb64a0fb741ef5f7fef94b3afa3538973510fbcfbbfc351d", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T11:40:58.828Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 25, "character_end_exclusive": 132, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "根据fpga大赛的pdf和大赛要求的报告，先做一个初步的大赛报告。我们目前缺少照片和视频，到时候再拍。你先利用这里所有能用到的资料，先写一个初步的大赛报告。我们选择的是AMD赛道的自主命题赛道。芯片应该符合要求吧。", "text_sha256": "a3a664bee5f41313ca23efd760eb8b9cd2a802530d94ac4ff909049582634800"}
{"excerpt_id": "c6_initial_missing", "source_id": "s3", "session_id": "01a16367-65ae-79f3-9fb4-524bd2443797", "source_line": 427, "source_line_sha256": "0247349bc3ce2d251b3489dd010127581085985f5269200bce5f3e738ab9d5ad", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T12:07:15.466Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 327, "character_end_exclusive": 414, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": true, "text": "接下来主要还缺：\n\n- 整机、板卡照片，演示视频和最新版界面截图。\n- 最新版三档全通道持续采集、冷启动、参数恢复及 TXT 写盘验证。\n- 真实大模型协作记录和独立技能包。", "text_sha256": "d34e228402a6f8881260b98135b953d87605d6d095c0692464e774f94f7083bd"}
{"excerpt_id": "c6_user_context", "source_id": "s3", "session_id": "01a16367-65ae-79f3-9fb4-524bd2443797", "source_line": 434, "source_line_sha256": "43ed95bcd7a206d3fbab32d4305cdfac3d90b5f5850cc2d080e0ddbb5164ba35", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T12:12:45.334Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 25, "character_end_exclusive": 92, "omitted_before": true, "omitted_after": false, "text": "这个文件夹里我又新增了一些图片，之前拍的一些。\n\n- 最新版三档全通道持续采集、冷启动、参数恢复及 TXT 写盘验证。你说的这个是什么", "text_sha256": "51f667d1e39de29cb3ef603bc2da2d4a19ca2014eb76ff5ebf9fc749f3d0f1e9"}
{"excerpt_id": "c6_explanation", "source_id": "s3", "session_id": "01a16367-65ae-79f3-9fb4-524bd2443797", "source_line": 470, "source_line_sha256": "05c18b43cf28b86671ed7f634ac973c9188cdfc33ca6c3119fdd8e964abddcd7", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T12:15:48.463Z", "role": "assistant", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 510, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": true, "text": "我说的是**给报告补充实测记录的四项检查**。“待补”表示现有资料还不足以确认对应结果，不代表功能有问题，也不要求把已经做过的测试全部重做。\n\n| 项目 | 具体是什么意思 |\n|---|---|\n| **三档全通道持续采集** | 24 路全部启用，分别用 **250 kSPS、500 kSPS、1 MSPS** 连续运行一段时间，记录运行时长、丢包和队列溢出等情况。 |\n| **冷启动** | 板卡彻底断电后重新供电，**不用电脑重新下载程序**，FPGA 能从 Flash 自动启动，并正常连接上位机、开始采集。 |\n| **参数恢复** | 在上位机修改采样率、IP 等参数并保存，断电重启后读取，检查保存的配置是否还在。A/B 副本损坏后的回退属于更深入的验证，可以后续补。 |\n| **TXT 写盘验证** | 勾选保存数据，实际采集后停止，检查最终 TXT 是否生成，24 路码值、电压和时间信息是否完整。 |\n\n“最新版”指的是 **10 月 10 日修复通道顺序后的 FPGA 程序**。已有旧版运行和启动记录可以使用，但报告里需要标清版本；如果你已经用最新版做过上述操作，补充实际情况或记录即可。", "text_sha256": "384090f582547d277fc17f54e52050e05e7792458faf49920ab299a414e8d432"}
{"excerpt_id": "c6_human_confirmation", "source_id": "s3", "session_id": "01a16367-65ae-79f3-9fb4-524bd2443797", "source_line": 477, "source_line_sha256": "d7ad93b44adb62737aa27b8529d7aad322ca08735761c861108db81ae65cf083", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T12:17:42.752Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 19, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "这些都做过，都没问题。然后技能包你来写", "text_sha256": "177d19aa5fde8ed4287f512de27c20698ce32ba28a674f4c9d7551e6471b7c28"}
{"excerpt_id": "c6_authorization", "source_id": "s3", "session_id": "01a16367-65ae-79f3-9fb4-524bd2443797", "source_line": 479, "source_line_sha256": "14ca8d9199ab7406f24f6455317552962a966963abf19edf7be06d367157d47d", "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T12:18:39.332Z", "role": "user", "channel_as_recorded": null, "record_type": "response_item.message", "excerpt_kind": "verbatim_contiguous_excerpt", "character_start": 0, "character_end_exclusive": 14, "omitted_before": false, "omitted_after": false, "text": "大模型协作记录和技能包你来写", "text_sha256": "08435ac3fb661a902692b5563721f0cee1370ad9aeb61dd466542ed78a8a6377"}
